Subject: [PATCH 1303/1389] =?UTF-8?q?HERESY=201169=20=C2=B7=201315:=20the?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20wave's=20sections=20from=20the=20lyrics'=20own=20tags,=20by?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20ear?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 10.10.2026, on his Buratino: «секуционка очень скудная на волне. Всего два verse показало. bridges вообще нет… можно улучшить?»; «при перетаскивании указателя курсора мыши по волне показывать в красивом попапе текст данной секции — прямо из оригинального текста лирики».

His Buratino takes are Full ones whose plans carry 4 to 13 «% section» comments while their lyrics have 32 tags; the wave drew the plan's marks. Now the sections are the lyrics' tags placed by the karaoke timing (Whisper's word times): a sung one at its first line heard (less the median heard line for each guessed line before it), an instrumental run sharing the gap to the next sung one, the unsung end left out when the time left could not hold it (else marked ?). The timing is asked once and kept: by itself on a machine of two cards or more, else from the take's menu («Find the sections by ear»). The pointer over the wave shows a card with the section, its time and its lines as written, the line sung there lit.

Measured on v9.3.6.8 (his r32): timed in 36 s, 112 lines, 60 % heard, 32 sections, Verse 1 at 25.1 s (after the intro).

Suite: 569/0 in the kitchen.

